<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.">
	<comment location="BufferBindingType">
		<summary> BufferBindingType is used to define the type of a buffer binding. </summary>
	</comment>
	<group prefix="BufferBindingType.">
		<comment location="Undefined">
			<summary> No buffer binding type is provided. </summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Uniform">
			<summary>A buffer for uniform values</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Storage">
			<summary>A storage buffer.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="ReadOnlyStorage">
			<summary>A storage buffer. The buffer can only be read in the shader</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="BindingNotUsed">
			<summary>
				 Indicates that this <see cref="WebGpuSharp.BufferBindingLayout">BufferBindingLayout</see> member of
				 its parent <see cref="WebGpuSharp.BindGroupLayoutEntry">BindGroupLayoutEntry</see> is not used.
			</summary>
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>